cket Lite Running Shoes, PUMA Black-PUMA Black-PUMA White, extralarge-IND\",\"href\":\"https://images.puma.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,b_rgb:fafafa,w_2000,h_2000/global/379437/01/sv02/fnd/IND/fmt/png/Skyrocket-Lite-Running-Shoes\",\"verticalImageHref\":\"https://images.puma.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,t_vertical_product/global/379437/01/sv02/fnd/IND/fmt/png/Skyrocket-Lite-Running-Shoes\",\"__typename\":\"ProductImage\"},{\"alt\":\"Skyrocket Lite Running Shoes, PUMA Black-PUMA Black-PUMA White, extralarge-IND\",\"href\":\"https://images.puma.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,b_rgb:fafafa,w_2000,h_2000/global/379437/01/sv03/fnd/IND/fmt/png/Skyrocket-Lite-Running-Shoes\",\"verticalImageHref\":\"https://images.puma.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,t_vertical_product/global/379437/01/sv03/fnd/IND/fmt/png/Skyrocket-Lite-Running-Shoes\",\"__typename\":\"ProductImage\"},{\"alt\":\"Skyrocket Lite Running Shoes, PUMA Black-PUMA Black-PUMA White, extralarge-IND\",\"href\":\"https://images.puma.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,b_rgb:fafafa,w_2000,h_2000/global/379437/01/sv04/fnd/IND/fmt/png/Skyrocket-Lite-Running-Shoes\",\"verticalImageHref\":\"https://images.puma.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,t_vertical_product/global/379437/01/sv04/fnd/IND/fmt/png/Skyrocket-Lite-Running-Shoes\",\"__typename\":\"ProductImage\"},{\"alt\":\"Skyrocket Lite Running Shoes, PUMA Black-PUMA Black-PUMA White, extralarge-IND\",\"href\":\"https://images.puma.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,b_rgb:fafafa,w_2000,h_2000/global/379437/01/dt05/fnd/IND/fmt/png/Skyrocket-Lite-Running-Shoes\",\"verticalImageHref\":\"https://images.puma.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,t_vertical_product/global/379437/01/dt05/fnd/IND/fmt/png/Skyrocket-Lite-Running-Shoes\",\"__typename\":\"ProductImage\"}],\"__typename\":\"Variant\",\"isFinalSale\":null,\"returnRuleID\":null,\"promotionExclusion\":false,\"specialMessage\":null,\"upc\":\"196859105260\",\"validUntil\":\"2027-04-10T11:36:19.000Z\",\"isAppExclusive\":false,\"badges\":[],\"percentageDiscountBadge\":45,\"salePrice\":2749,\"productPrice\":{\"price\":4999,\"salePrice\":2749,\"promotionPrice\":null,\"isSalePriceElapsed\":null,\"tax\":204,\"taxRate\":0.08,\"bestPrice\":null,\"__typename\":\"ProductPrice\"},\"styleNumber\":\"379437_01\",\"materialComposition\":[\"Midsole: 100% Synthetic\",\"Sockliner: 100% Textile\",\"Outsole: 80.40% Rubber, 19.60% Synthetic\",\"Upper: 69.93% Textile, 30.07% Synthetic\",\"Lining: 100% Textile\"],\"displayOutOfStock\":null,\"orderable\":true,\"modelMeasurementText\":null,\"productStory\":{\"longDescription\":\"\u003ch3\u003ePRODUCT STORY\u003c/h3\u003eIntroducing the Skyrocket Lite, PUMA's most exciting new performance shoe, exactly what you need to go fast and go far. Offering great durability and traction wherever you run, the Skyrocket upper is breathable and comfortable and ready for anything.\u003ch3\u003eFEATURES \u0026 BENEFITS\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003ePUMALite :\u0026nbsp;Ultra Lightweight foam built with at least 10% recycled EVA and focused for comfort.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSOFTFOAM+: Step-in comfort sockliner designed to provide soft cushioning thanks to its extra thick heel\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eThe upper of the shoes is made with at least 20% recycled materials and the bottom is made with at least 10% recycled materials.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eDETAILS\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eBuilt on a RUN PUMA performance last for an ideal fit on the run.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eFull length rubber coverage for durability and traction\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eLaces\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eRounded toe\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eFit Plus webbing for ample lacing lockdown.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eProtread rubber providing durability and great traction\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"__typename\":\"ProductStory\"},\"manufacturerInfo\":{\"manufacturerAddress\":{\"label\":\"Manufacturer's address\",\"content\":[\"ALERON VIET NAM FOOTWEAR\",\"LIMITED\",\"FVNEC\",\"THANH HOA PROVINCE\",\"HOANG LONG INDUSTRIAL ZONE\",\"NGUYET VIEN WARD\",\"440000\",null],\"__typename\":\"Info\"},\"countryOfOrigin\":{\"label\":\"Country of Origin\",\"content\":[\"Vietnam\"],\"__typename\":\"Info\"},\"__typename\":\"ManufacturerInfo\"},\"myCustomizer\":null,\"configureID\":null,\"taxDisplayMsg\":\"(Prices include GST)\",\"promotions\":[{\"id\":\"PUMA_MidSeasonsale_20pc_Mar_2026\",\"calloutMessage\":\"Extra 20% off auto applied at checkout\",\"__typename\":\"ProductPromotion\"}],\"appOnlyDateTimeFrom\":null,\"appOnlyDateTimeTo\":null},{\"id\":\"379437_02\",\"masterId\":\"379437\",\"variantId\":\"4099686355746\",\"name\":\"Skyrocket Lite Running Shoes\",\"header\":null,\"subHeader\":null,\"slug\":null,\"price\":4999,\"colorValue\":\"02\",\"colorName\":\"PUMA Navy-PUMA Black-PUMA White\",\"ean\":\"4099686355746\",\"preview\":\"https://images.puma.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,b_rgb:fafafa,w_2000,h_2000/global/379437/02/sv01/fnd/IND/fmt/png/Skyrocket-Lite-Running-Shoes\",\"images\":[{\"alt\":\"Skyrocket Lite Running Shoes, PUMA Navy-PUMA Black-PUMA White, extralarge-IND\",\"href\":\"https://images.puma.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,b_rgb:fafafa,w_2000,h_2000/global/379437/02/sv01/fnd/IND/fmt/png/Skyrocket-Lite-Running-Shoes\",\"verticalImageHref\":\"https://images.puma.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,t_vertical_product/global/379437/02/sv01/fnd/IND/fmt/png/Skyrocket-Lite-Running-Shoes\",\"__typename\":\"ProductImage\"},{\"alt\":\"Skyrocket Lite Running Shoes, PUMA Navy-PUMA Black-PUMA White, extralarge-IND\",\"href\":\"https://images.puma.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,b_rgb:fafafa,w_2000,h_2000/global/379437/02/fnd/IND/fmt/png/Skyrocket-Lite-Running-Shoes\",\"verticalImageHref\":\"https://images.puma.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,t_vertical_product/global/379437/02/fnd/IND/fmt/png/Skyrocket-Lite-Running-Shoes\",\"__typename\":\"ProductImage\"},{\"alt\":\"Skyrocket Lite Running Shoes, PUMA Navy-PUMA Black-PUMA White, extralarge-IND\",\"href\":\"https://images.puma.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,b_rgb:fafafa,w_2000,h_2000/global/379437/02/bv/fnd/IND/fmt/png/Skyrocket-Lite-Running-Shoes\",\"verticalImageHref\":\"https://images.puma.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,t_vertical_product/global/379437/02/bv/fnd/IND/fmt/png/Skyrocket-Lite-Running-Shoes\",\"__typename\":\"ProductImage\"},{\"alt\":\"Skyrocket Lite Running Shoes, PUMA Navy-PUMA Black-PUMA White, extralarge-IND\",\"href\":\"https://images.puma.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,b_rgb:fafafa,w_2000,h_2000/global/379437/02/sv02/fnd/IND/fmt/png/Skyrocket-Lite-Running-Shoes\",\"verticalImageHref\":\"https://images.puma.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,t_vertical_product/global/379437/02/sv02/fnd/IND/fmt/png/Skyrocket-Lite-Running-Shoes\",\"__typename\":\"ProductImage\"},{\"alt\":\"Skyrocket Lite Running Shoes, PUMA Navy-PUMA Black-PUMA White, extralarge-IND\",\"href\":\"https://images.puma.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,b_rgb:fafafa,w_2000,h_2000/global/379437/02/sv03/fnd/IND/fmt/png/Skyrocket-Lite-Running-Shoes\",\"verticalImageHref\":\"https://images.puma.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,t_vertical_product/global/379437/02/sv03/fnd/IND/fmt/png/Skyrocket-Lite-Running-Shoes\",\"__typename\":\"ProductImage\"},{\"alt\":\"Skyrocket Lite Running Shoes, PUMA Navy-PUMA Black-PUMA White, extralarge-IND\",\"href\":\"https://images.puma.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,b_rgb:fafafa,w_2000,h_2000/global/379437/02/sv04/fnd/IND/fmt/png/Skyrocket-Lite-Running-Shoes\",\"verticalImageHref\":\"https://images.puma.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,t_vertical_product/global/379437/02/sv04/fnd/IND/fmt/png/Skyrocket-Lite-Running-Shoes\",\"__typename\":\"ProductImage\"}],\"__typename\":\"Variant\",\"isFinalSale\":null,\"returnRuleID\":null,\"promotionExclusion\":false,\"specialMessage\":null,\"upc\":\"196859355740\",\"validUntil\":\"2027-04-10T11:36:20.000Z\",\"isAppExclusive\":false,\"badges\":[],\"percentageDiscountBadge\":40,\"salePrice\":2999,\"productPrice